{"4977890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cargo Thieves", "steam_appid": 4977890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5167970], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cargo Thieves</strong> is a cooperative action game where you play as dockworkers who have absolutely no intention of doing honest work. <strong>Quietly cracking open cargo, stealing anything of value, and selling it to the shady underworld around the port</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a game about <strong>chaos, improvisation, sabotage, and creative thievery</strong>, where every shift in the harbor is a new opportunity for quick cash… or a spectacular disaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal, improvise, escape</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneak into containers</strong>: use crowbars, lockpicks, hammers, or just brute force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid the guards</strong>: they react to noise, light, movement, and suspicious behavior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell your loot</strong>: from food and electronics to luxury cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create chaos</strong>: start fires, sabotage machinery, trigger alarms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drink beer</strong>: because nothing improves teamwork like questionable decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work together in co‑op</strong>: one distracts, one steals, one drives the getaway truck.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The port underworld economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your stolen goods to smugglers, fishermen, truck drivers, electronics dealers, or even other dockworkers. Everyone has their own prices, preferences, and risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to buy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >better tools,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >container maps,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >delivery intel,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >crew upgrades,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cosmetics and ridiculous gadgets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High risk means high reward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co‑op for 1–4 players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed as a <strong>fun, slightly criminal co‑op experience</strong>, where communication and improvisation matter more than skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >solo,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with a partner,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or with a full crew of four thieves.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple: <strong>Make money, steal everything you can, and don’t get caught.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more chaos you create, the higher the risk… and the bigger the payout.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cargo Thieves</strong> is a cooperative action game where you play as dockworkers who have absolutely no intention of doing honest work. <strong>Quietly cracking open cargo, stealing anything of value, and selling it to the shady underworld around the port</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a game about <strong>chaos, improvisation, sabotage, and creative thievery</strong>, where every shift in the harbor is a new opportunity for quick cash… or a spectacular disaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal, improvise, escape</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneak into containers</strong>: use crowbars, lockpicks, hammers, or just brute force.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid the guards</strong>: they react to noise, light, movement, and suspicious behavior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell your loot</strong>: from food and electronics to luxury cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create chaos</strong>: start fires, sabotage machinery, trigger alarms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drink beer</strong>: because nothing improves teamwork like questionable decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work together in co‑op</strong>: one distracts, one steals, one drives the getaway truck.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The port underworld economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your stolen goods to smugglers, fishermen, truck drivers, electronics dealers, or even other dockworkers. Everyone has their own prices, preferences, and risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to buy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >better tools,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >container maps,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >delivery intel,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >crew upgrades,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cosmetics and ridiculous gadgets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High risk means high reward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co‑op for 1–4 players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed as a <strong>fun, slightly criminal co‑op experience</strong>, where communication and improvisation matter more than skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >solo,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with a partner,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or with a full crew of four thieves.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple: <strong>Make money, steal everything you can, and don’t get caught.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more chaos you create, the higher the risk… and the bigger the payout.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "A co-op game where you're dockworkers who, in